/*
 * query::completion — the names that can be written at a position.
 *
 * The line being written does not always parse, so what precedes a `.` or a
 * `::` is found in the text, and resolved by the token at its position if it
 * was indexed, by its name among the entities visible there otherwise.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::query::completion
 * @File: ymirc/query/completion.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-10-01
